cff-version: 1.2.0
title: proteinbrowser
message: >-
  If you use these tools, please cite the article in preferred-citation.
abstract: >-
  This repository collects the demos, JBrowse 2 plugins and source repositories
  behind the paper "Proteins in the Genome Browser," which integrate protein
  structures, multiple sequence alignments and phylogenies with nucleotide-level
  evidence in JBrowse 2.
type: software
repository-code: https://github.com/GMOD/proteinbrowser
